      "id": "b04ff962-3318-444b-b701-137822d820a8",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Hey, I wanted to chat about the database options for our new analytics product. What are your initial thoughts on keeping maintenance low?",
      "input_source": "voice",
      "status": "final",
      "revision": 1,
      "provider_item_id": "gemini_output_59fdc9a2c1944d8db468ccabc34e5532",
      "response_id": "gemini_response_0a89d37a8de445c999ccd5cbe2bfa7a1",
      "client_turn_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:02:48.878998+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "518762a8-7262-4a65-a8a9-ac3ecc0df804",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "role": "user",
      "text": "We need a database for a small analytics product and our engineering team is only three people.",
      "input_source": "text",
      "status": "final",
      "revision": 1,
      "provider_item_id": "item_69cdf2bfc9a44af084561ec1",
      "response_id": null,
      "client_turn_id": "2a7fc9b9-1020-4824-ae13-c2176bfa823c",
      "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:02:50.157912+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad13d0bd-8798-4258-b726-f418315757dd",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "With such a small team, we have to be careful. How do you see us balancing maintenance effort with the reliability we need?",
      "input_source": "voice",
      "status": "final",
      "revision": 1,
      "provider_item_id": "gemini_output_57ffa9572813433ebfc7bdda019ec739",
      "response_id": "gemini_response_b1110b4cdb2b427eb1cbb65bacdd030a",
      "client_turn_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:03:00.020397+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "864bd8c5-6ab0-4e5d-9aeb-2d6e0a5d34a7",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Our budget is limited and we cannot spend much time maintaining servers.",
      "input_source": "text",
      "status": "final",
      "revision": 1,
      "provider_item_id": "item_a0f78c13570c43cdbb0517f9",
      "response_id": null,
      "client_turn_id": "c797e04c-6664-464f-8eba-b0550d37c2cb",
      "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:03:02.364912+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "4156dc5b-dcfa-45a4-b5d9-4b706d990d0a",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "That makes sense. Given those constraints, have you considered any specific types of databases that might work well for us?",
      "input_source": "voice",
      "status": "interrupted",
      "revision": 1,
      "provider_item_id": "gemini_output_19de3de8d03c4946bf17ef1b1ce2b426",
      "response_id": "gemini_response_915a3e08210c4786a51e68e80114ce11",
      "client_turn_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:03:12.284678+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "2781327a-4bb9-43f5-bbcc-a8f95dd2c401",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I want to make a short comparison of the two choices: lower monthly bills on one side, less maintenance work and fewer outages on the other.",
      "input_source": "text",
      "status": "final",
      "revision": 1,
      "provider_item_id": "item_dc84ddd9d44a422daf5605b7",
      "response_id": null,
      "client_turn_id": "054bd8ea-5d7d-4c5f-8c9d-10ab817859e0",
      "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:03:14.715183+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "47bc3448-a336-4a99-8628-13566141447c",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "That's a classic trade-off. Which approach do you think aligns better with our team's current situation?",
      "input_source": "voice",
      "status": "final",
      "revision": 1,
      "provider_item_id": "gemini_output_d9de22d13bce4b289047dad5ec3cf221",
      "response_id": "gemini_response_5f5517a8d4a348ec9473dd908c36e024",
      "client_turn_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:03:22.439591+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "703d557f-55c7-499a-bba9-ae50cb59cbde",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I'm still deciding which downside our team could accept.",
      "input_source": "text",
      "status": "final",
      "revision": 1,
      "provider_item_id": "item_5aa905be08174c36b03be9d6",
      "response_id": null,
      "client_turn_id": "bfb86788-0a76-4593-8e80-62900e62d8e6",
      "created_at": "2026-10-18T15:03:24.715843+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "2b86dd5f-b5ee-4545-ac22-541d7beda589",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "It's a tough call. How would you frame the compromise between the cheaper option and the more reliable one?",
      "input_source": "voice",
      "status": "final",
      "revision": 1,
      "provider_item_id": "gemini_output_fd4e3f5b631f4facb9e97cc42d3b2a92",
